A/B TESTING AND HYPOTHESIS TESTING RESULTS

Group A:
Visitors: 1000
Conversions: 130
Conversion Rate: 13%

Group B:
Visitors: 1000
Conversions: 214
Conversion Rate: 21.4%

HYPOTHESIS TESTING:

Null Hypothesis (H0):
There is no significant difference between Group A and Group B.

Alternative Hypothesis (H1):
There is a significant difference between Group A and Group B.

Significance Level: 0.05

Conclusion:
Group B has a higher conversion rate than Group A.
The statistical test is used to determine whether this difference
is statistically significant.
